==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|chur||Bermuda}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sed-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|chayer}}, {{m|enm|chaire}}, {{m|enm|chaiere}}, {{m|enm|chaere}}, {{m|enm|chayre}}, {{m|enm|chayere}}, from {{der|en|fro|chaiere}}, {{m|fro|chaere}}, from {{der|en|la|cathedra|t=seat}}, from {{der|en|grc|καθέδρα}}, from {{m|grc|κατά|t=down}} + {{m|grc|ἕδρα|t=seat}}. Displaced native {{m|en|stool}} and {{m|en|settle}}, which now have more specialised senses. {{doublet|en|cathedra|chaise}}.

